      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A 71-year-old woman presented with syncope in association with unstable angina. Coronary angiography and subsequent postmortem findings demonstrated severe coronary arterial disease. The importance of the association of syncope with unstable angina and possible underlying mechanisms are discussed."},
